401
=== note
A scoped token made without write:page:confluence. The body is the one page-unauthorized has for a missing read scope; Atlassian's support article on a scoped token's 401s names a missing scope as a cause. The bead says 403 for this, and the description lists no 403 for the request (update-forbidden is that row).
